    "body": "Split from #36808.\n\nThis PR fixes IWYU warnings in the following source files and their associated headers, and add them to `IWYU_SRC_FILES`, so that any new warnings there fail CI:\n- `chain.cpp`\n- `headerssync.cpp`\n- `key_io.cpp`\n- `merkleblock.cpp`\n- `pow.cpp`\n\nThe changes in other files add includes of headers that were previously included transitively.",
